Package: hypr-window-rotate
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, hyprland (= ${hyprland:Version})
Description: Hyprland plugin to rotate individual windows in 90 degree steps
 hypr-window-rotate rotates single windows of the Hyprland compositor in
 90 degree steps. The window keeps its place in the layout; the application
 is configured with the swapped size, drawn rotated, and pointer input is
 mapped back, so a rotated window stays fully usable.
